---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms"
  description="Service terms for the mdbase.dev website and mdbase Connect private beta."
>
  <article class="legal">
    <header>
      <h1>Terms</h1>
      <p>Terms for the public website and pre-release Connect services.</p>
    </header>
    <h2>Open source materials</h2>
    <p>
      The mdbase specification and open source software are provided under the
      licenses stated in their repositories. Those licenses govern source code,
      conformance fixtures, examples, and documentation distributed with the
      projects.
    </p>
    <h2>Private beta</h2>
    <p>
      mdbase Connect is pre-release software. Availability, storage, routing,
      and account features may change before a public release. Keep independent
      backups of important collections. Treat the private beta as a working
      copy of data.
    </p>
    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>
      Use the service within applicable law and granted access. Authorized
      security testing must stay within its agreed scope. Interference with
      other users and bypassing application grants or collection authority
      checks are prohibited.
    </p>
    <h2>No warranty</h2>
    <p>
      Pre-release services carry no warranty to the extent permitted by law.
      Open source components retain the warranty terms in their respective
      licenses.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
